          Every line has a name and a date.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-gray-200 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          You already have a dashboard, and that is what matters most. To make it useful for deciding every week, it often lacks two small things: knowing who follows each figure, and how old it is.
        </p>
        <!-- Author -->
